    {
      "section": "Relay Time Monitor Bundle for DeepSeek Harness",
      "text": "> **Stable `0.1.2` is verified on official DSH `0.1.5-rc.2`\n> and `0.1.6-alpha.1`.** No implementation adaptation was required; its peer\n> metadata declares both exact releases.\n\n[](https://www.npmjs.com/package/relay-dsh-plugin-monitor-time)\n[](https://github.com/yangbobo2021/relay-dsh-plugin-monitor-time/actions/workflows/ci.yml)\n[](LICENSE)\n\nEnglish | [中文](README.zh.md)"
    },
    {
      "section": "Relay Time Monitor Bundle for DeepSeek Harness",
      "text": "This extension adds the discoverable `time.deadline` Monitor Bundle Type and the\n`relay_schedule_timer` convenience tool to Relay. Install it with Relay Events and\nMonitor Core. The extension reads only the host clock and supports English and\nSimplified Chinese catalog metadata.\n\nInstall the exact public release with the required Relay plugins:"
    },
    {
      "section": "Relay Time Monitor Bundle for DeepSeek Harness",
      "text": "```bash\nnpx @deepseek-ai/dsh@0.1.3-rc.1 plugin --profile web add --save-exact \\\n  relay-dsh-plugin-events@0.2.3-rc.1 \\\n  relay-dsh-plugin-monitors@0.3.2-rc.1 \\\n  relay-dsh-plugin-monitor-time@0.1.3-rc.1\n\nGit source is also installable for release verification:\n\n```bash\nnpx @deepseek-ai/dsh@0.1.3-rc.1 plugin --profile web add --save-exact \\\n  github:yangbobo2021/relay-dsh-plugin-monitor-time#v0.1.3-rc.1\n```\n\nThe same artifact retains compatibility with audited DSH `0.1.2-alpha.3` profiles."
    },
    {
      "section": "Relay Time Monitor Bundle for DeepSeek Harness",
      "text": "See [SPEC.md](SPEC.md) and [delivery scenarios](docs/acceptance-scenarios.md)."
    }
